  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>MIT</project_license>
  <name>SharpSelecta</name>
  <summary>Music player for your local library</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.ghorshy">
    <name>ghorshy</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>SharpSelecta plays the music you keep as files on your own disk. Point it at your folders and it builds a library you can browse as a table or as an album grid with covers.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>MP3, FLAC, WAV, AIFF, Ogg Vorbis and M4A (AAC and ALAC), with a library that updates as files change on disk</li>
      <li>A queue with Auto DJ, ReplayGain normalization and a 10-band equalizer</li>
      <li>A tag editor with online cover search, and conversion between file types</li>
      <li>Media keys and playerctl through MPRIS, notifications, a tray icon and an optional Discord status</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
